c120 pwat-parm3
c
c    defid   parameter group id
c    deluid  landuse id
c    petmax  air temperature below which e-t will is reduced (deg F)
c    petmin  air temperature below which e-t is set to zero (deg F)
c    infexp  exponent in the infiltration equation (none)
