c    deluid  landuse id
c    jan-dec concentration of constituent in surface flow at start of each month (mg/l), (ug/l), or (mpn/100ml)
c if in card 250, the unit is mpn/100ml, the above unit should be mpn/100ml
c
c	defid	dwqid	deluid	jan	feb	mar	apr	may	jun	jul	aug	sep	oct	nov	dec
c---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
c273 mon-interflow concentration (moninterconc)
c    only required if viqcfg = 1 (see card 255)
c
c    defid   parameter group id
c    dwqid   general quality id
c    deluid  landuse id
c    jan-dec concentration of constituent in interflow at start of each month (mg/l), (ug/l), or (mpn/100ml)
c if in card 250, the unit is mpn/100ml, the above unit should be mpn/100ml
c
c	defid	dwqid	deluid	jan	feb	mar	apr	may	jun	jul	aug	sep	oct	nov	dec
c---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
c274 mon-groundwater concentration (mongrndconc)
c    only required if vaqcfg = 1 (see card 255)
c
c    defid   parameter group id
c    dwqid   general quality id
c    deluid  landuse id
c    jan-dec concentration of constituent in groundwater at start of each month (mg/l), (ug/l), or (mpn/100ml)
