c    adpm2     distribution coefficients for qual with suspended silt (l/mg)
c    adpm3     distribution coefficients for qual with suspended clay (l/mg)
c    adpm4     distribution coefficients for qual with bed sand (l/mg)
c    adpm5     distribution coefficients for qual with bed silt (l/mg)
c    adpm6     distribution coefficients for qual with bed clay (l/mg)
c
c	rgid	dwqid	adpm1	adpm2	adpm3	adpm4	adpm5	adpm6
